1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,509
Now let's watch Ana and Ben play a whole game, using everything you learned.

2
00:00:04,829 --> 00:00:08,562
We'll slow down for the big moments, and skip quickly through the rest.

3
00:00:09,566 --> 00:00:11,060
Ana is at the bottom.

4
00:00:11,379 --> 00:00:12,638
Ben is at the top.

5
00:00:12,958 --> 00:00:16,457
The bowl starts with a green, a purple, a blue and a red.

6
00:00:16,777 --> 00:00:20,574
Ana goes first, so her Take Two Stones card starts face-down.

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,460
Turn 1.

8
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:25,233
Ana plays Add Two Stones and Take One.

9
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,652
Into the bowl: a Spirit Stone and a white.

10
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:31,296
She gives a green stone to the Salmon.

11
00:00:31,966 --> 00:00:33,737
Let's skip ahead a few turns.

12
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,424
Turn 5.

13
00:00:38,744 --> 00:00:40,386
Ana plays Spirit Power.

14
00:00:40,706 --> 00:00:41,944
She picks the Wolf.

15
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:45,373
Into the bowl: a red, two purple and a blue.

16
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:48,081
She gives a yellow stone to the Salmon.

17
00:00:49,733 --> 00:00:51,056
A few quick turns.

18
00:00:53,233 --> 00:00:54,193
Turn 8.

19
00:00:54,513 --> 00:00:56,092
Ben plays Spirit Power.

20
00:00:56,412 --> 00:00:57,798
He picks the Bison.

21
00:00:58,466 --> 00:01:01,240
Into the bowl: two Spirit Stones and a red.

22
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,820
He gives a red stone to the Rabbit.

23
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:07,444
Then the Bison sends a Spirit Stone back into the bag.

24
00:01:07,763 --> 00:01:09,598
That makes the game last longer.

25
00:01:11,266 --> 00:01:12,269
Turn 9.

26
00:01:12,589 --> 00:01:14,338
Ana plays Take One Stone.

27
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,157
She puts a Spirit Stone on the Salmon's times-two space.

28
00:01:18,477 --> 00:01:19,565
Double points!

29
00:01:19,885 --> 00:01:21,656
That animal is now closed.

30
00:01:22,333 --> 00:01:23,463
Fast forward.

31
00:01:24,133 --> 00:01:25,157
Turn 11.

32
00:01:25,477 --> 00:01:28,463
Ana plays Add Three Stones and Move Coyote.

33
00:01:29,133 --> 00:01:32,567
Into the bowl: a Spirit Stone, a white and a purple.

34
00:01:33,233 --> 00:01:35,814
Ana moves the Coyote onto Ben's Turtle.

35
00:01:36,466 --> 00:01:38,770
That's three Spirit Stones out of the bag.

36
00:01:39,433 --> 00:01:40,563
Skipping ahead.

37
00:01:41,233 --> 00:01:42,385
Turn 13.

38
00:01:42,705 --> 00:01:44,347
Ana plays Spirit Power.

39
00:01:44,667 --> 00:01:45,990
She picks the Eagle.

40
00:01:46,666 --> 00:01:48,693
She gives a white stone to the Beaver.

41
00:01:50,366 --> 00:01:52,371
The Eagle gives Ana another turn!

42
00:01:53,033 --> 00:01:54,227
Quick turns now.

43
00:01:57,899 --> 00:01:59,158
Turn 17.

44
00:01:59,478 --> 00:02:01,057
Ben plays Spirit Power.

45
00:02:01,377 --> 00:02:02,550
He picks the Deer.

46
00:02:03,233 --> 00:02:06,603
The Deer moves a red stone from his Rabbit back to the bowl.

47
00:02:07,266 --> 00:02:09,186
He gives a white stone to the Turtle.

48
00:02:09,506 --> 00:02:11,469
He gives a blue stone to the Rabbit.

49
00:02:13,133 --> 00:02:14,903
Let's skip ahead a few turns.

50
00:02:15,566 --> 00:02:16,718
Turn 19.

51
00:02:17,038 --> 00:02:18,745
Ben plays Take Two Stones.

52
00:02:19,399 --> 00:02:21,319
He gives a red stone to the Rabbit.

53
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:23,687
He gives a yellow stone to the Rabbit.

54
00:02:24,366 --> 00:02:25,369
Turn 20.

55
00:02:25,689 --> 00:02:27,331
Ana plays Spirit Power.

56
00:02:27,651 --> 00:02:28,910
She picks the Ram.

57
00:02:29,566 --> 00:02:33,129
The Ram draws a red and a Spirit Stone straight from the bag.

58
00:02:33,449 --> 00:02:35,454
She gives a red stone to the Rabbit.

59
00:02:35,774 --> 00:02:38,846
She puts a Spirit Stone on the Rabbit's times-two space.

60
00:02:39,166 --> 00:02:40,254
Double points!

61
00:02:40,574 --> 00:02:42,345
That animal is now closed.

62
00:02:43,999 --> 00:02:46,239
That's four Spirit Stones out of the bag.

63
00:02:46,559 --> 00:02:48,415
One more, and the game ends.

64
00:02:49,066 --> 00:02:50,261
Turn 21.

65
00:02:50,581 --> 00:02:52,266
Ben plays Take One Stone.

66
00:02:52,933 --> 00:02:56,005
He puts a Spirit Stone on the Rabbit's times-two space.

67
00:02:56,325 --> 00:02:57,413
Double points!

68
00:02:57,733 --> 00:02:59,503
That animal is now closed.

69
00:03:00,166 --> 00:03:01,361
Turn 22.

70
00:03:01,681 --> 00:03:04,134
Ana plays Add Two Stones and Take One.

71
00:03:04,799 --> 00:03:07,423
Into the bowl: a Spirit Stone and a blue.

72
00:03:08,099 --> 00:03:10,041
She gives a green stone to the Owl.

73
00:03:10,699 --> 00:03:13,579
Five Spirit Stones are out at the end of the turn.

74
00:03:13,899 --> 00:03:14,902
Game over!

75
00:03:15,566 --> 00:03:18,809
Ana: Rabbit 12, Turtle 1 and Salmon 18.

76
00:03:19,129 --> 00:03:20,387
31 points.

77
00:03:21,066 --> 00:03:24,842
Ben: Rabbit 12, Turtle 3, Owl 4 and Beaver 10.

78
00:03:25,162 --> 00:03:26,463
29 points.

79
00:03:27,133 --> 00:03:29,565
Ana wins, 31 to 29!

80
00:03:29,885 --> 00:03:31,250
Thanks for watching.
